---
title: CatLium EduTech — Cookie Auth + Tenant-Scoped Request Flow
---
%%{init: {'htmlLabels':false,'sequence':{'useMaxWidth':false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (Next.js web)
    participant N as nginx (/api/ -> api:3000)
    participant C as AuthController
    participant S as AuthService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant T as TenantGuard
    participant R as RolesGuard
    participant M as Feature Service

    B->>N: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    N->>C: forward (same origin /api/v1)
    C->>S: login(email, password)
    S->>DB: SELECT users WHERE email (normalized)
    DB-->>S: user row (status, passwordHash)
    S->>DB: bcrypt.compare(password, passwordHash)
    S->>DB: INSERT auth_sessions (refreshTokenHash, expiresAt)  [createSession]
    S-->>C: { user, accessToken, refreshToken, csrfToken }
    C-->>B: 200 + set-cookie x3 (access_token, refresh_token httpOnly, csrf_token)

    alt Authenticated request (e.g. GET /content)
        B->>N: GET /content + Cookie + x-institute-id header
        N->>C: forward
        Note over C,T: Guard stack: AccessToken → Tenant → Roles
        C->>T: AccessTokenGuard verifies access_token JWT → request.user.userId
        T->>DB: getMembership → memberships ⋈ membership_roles (user, institute, active)
        DB-->>T: membership + roles
        T-->>C: request.tenant = {instituteId, membershipId, roles}
        C->>R: RolesGuard checks @RequiredRoles vs tenant.roles
        C->>M: service call scoped by tenant.instituteId
        M->>DB: every query WHERE institute_id = tenant
        DB-->>M: rows (tenant-scoped)
        M-->>C: response
        C-->>B: 200 JSON
    end

    opt Refresh rotation
        B->>C: POST /auth/refresh (refresh_token + csrf)
        C->>S: verifyRefreshToken → session lookup
        S->>S: decideRefreshRace (rotation/revoke/expired)
        S->>DB: revoke old session, INSERT new session
        C-->>B: rotated cookie set
    end